<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Sharp 1996 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Sharp 1996 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian electronic goods manufacturer Sharp S/A Equipamentos Eletronicos issued the following statement on its 1996 results</p>
<p>			 1996			    1995</p>
<p>    shr profit	 0.1323 real	    loss 0.0026 real</p>
<p>    net profit	 16.2 million		 loss 312,000</p>
<p>    net oprtnl rvs   970.9 million		     827.4 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais. Share profit figures provided per 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
